; The variant-order check (CLAUDE.md, ordering convention). A type opts in with
; an [@alphabetical] marker comment on the line above it. Attached to runtest,
; so `make runtest`, `make precommit` and CI all run it; `make
; check.variant-order` runs it alone.
;
; The source tree is a dependency, so editing any file under lib reruns it.

(executable
 (name variant_order)
 (modules variant_order))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps
  (source_tree ../../lib))
 (action
  (run %{exe:variant_order.exe} check ../.. lib)))
